<title>UK: BOE allots 397 mln stg to discount houses via repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 397 mln stg to discount houses via repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided a total of 397 million stg to discount houses via repo.</p>
<p>It had earlier provided a total of 1.501 billion stg in liquidity in the form of 6.25 percent repos to June 4 and 5 and outright bills maturing on or before June 5.</p>
<p>The Bank's last liquidity shortage forecast was 1.85 billion stg.</p>
</text>
